---
import InformationPage from "../components/InformationPage.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import "../styles/information.css";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About | FundraisingDirectory.net"
  description="Learn how FundraisingDirectory.net helps groups independently explore fundraising ideas, methods, and providers."
>
  <InformationPage
    eyebrow="About the directory"
    title="A clearer starting point for fundraising research."
    intro="FundraisingDirectory.net helps schools, teams, nonprofits, faith communities, clubs, and individuals discover fundraising methods, ideas, and providers."
  >
    <section>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        We organize public information so visitors can compare broad fundraising
        approaches and learn which providers may be worth evaluating. The
        directory is an independent information and discovery resource; it does
        not run campaigns or process fundraising transactions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Carrying the directory forward</h2>
      <p>
        This project carries forward the FundraisingDirectory.net name while
        rebuilding the older A-to-Z directory into a current, structured
        resource. Useful historical addresses are being preserved while their
        information is reviewed and modernized.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How listings are handled</h2>
      <p>
        Provider records are based on identified sources and include review
        dates. Organic listings, future featured placement, and future sponsored
        placement are distinct. Paid visibility will never silently imply an
        editorial endorsement.
      </p>
      <a class="information-link" href="/providers/">Browse researched providers →</a>
    </section>
  </InformationPage>
</SiteLayout>
